  "title": "AGTTM Part 8 - Processes and Procedures",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 8 establishes the organizational framework for temporary traffic management, defining roles, responsibilities, and administrative processes essential for effective traffic management operations. This standard details the functional relationships between road authorities, contractors, and personnel involved in temporary traffic management. It provides comprehensive guidance on the competency framework, certification requirements, documentation standards, record keeping obligations, incident reporting procedures, and the process for managing variations to traffic management plans.",
